And I achieved this by writing the code below, maybe it can help someone else.

##### Example Category Tree

* Clothing
  * Clothing > Dresses
    * Clothing > Dresses > Mini Dresses
    * Clothing > Dresses > Midi Dresses
  * Clothing > Tops
  * Clothing > Bottoms
  * Clothing > Outwears
* Accessories
  * Accessories > Jewelery
  * Accessories > Bags

##### Javascript

```javascript
search.addWidget(
  instantsearch.widgets.hierarchicalMenu({
    container: '#categories',
    attributes: [ 'category','sub_category','sub_sub_category'],
    sortBy: customSort
  })
);
var categories = ["Clothing", "Clothing > Dresses", "Clothing > Dresses > Mini Dresses", "Clothing > Dresses > Midi Dresses",...];
function customSort(a,b){
    if(a.path.split(">").length==1){ //category
        return categories.indexOf(a.path) - categories.indexOf(b.path);
    }else if(a.path.split(">").length==2){ //sub_category
        return a.name > b.name;
    }else{
         //sub_sub_category
        return a.count < b.count;
    }
}
```
